{"ts": "2026-10-31T09:34:35.045973Z", "run_id": "r-20261031T0855Z-e7d0", "unit": "openspec:add-admin-api", "seq": 85, "type": "delegate.result", "question": "Q-004", "id": "Q-004", "status": "answered", "reason": "Read src/api/error-codes.ts (22 entries, each status and message equal to the scenario's) and src/api/error-codes.test.ts (asserts exact key set, per-entry status and message, isRegisteredCode true for all 22 and false for the three negatives of the scenario). The judge passed; the only hold was missing proof of discrimination, which the assertions themselves settle. design.md records that the test was changed in place under its old title by task 5.1.", "called": true, "tasks": [], "target": "C-96e47324", "kind": "verdict", "profile": "delegate-fable", "model": "claude-fable-5-1", "cli": "claude-code", "cost_usd": 0.86020275, "decision": "accept", "answer_sha256": "6f987711d2dcd75dbeb6652c1adc3a3f23848dd2417fc8451845499ed132c1a0", "checked": [{"ref": "src/api/error-codes.ts:25", "quote": "ALREADY_EXISTS: { status: 409, message: \"Resource already exists\" },", "claim": "The registry holds the six new codes with the scenario's statuses and messages, bringing it to exactly 22 entries."}, {"ref": "src/api/error-codes.ts:30", "quote": "message: \"Paging needs the engine key (URSITOARE_ENGINE_KEY_FILE)\",", "claim": "ENGINE_KEY_REQUIRED carries the exact message the scenario requires."}, {"ref": "src/api/error-codes.test.ts:46", "quote": "assert.deepEqual(Object.keys(ERROR_CODES).sort(), Object.keys(EXPECTED_CODES).sort());", "claim": "The test asserts the exact key set of the registry against 22 expected codes, which would fail against the 16-code base registry."}, {"ref": "src/api/error-codes.test.ts:48", "quote": "assert.deepEqual(ERROR_CODES[code], expected, code);", "claim": "The test checks status and message of every one of the 22 entries."}, {"ref": "src/api/error-codes.test.ts:63", "quote": "for (const code of [\"cursor_invalid\", \"\", \"NOT_A_CODE\", \"constructor\"]) {", "claim": "The test checks isRegisteredCode is false for cursor_invalid, the empty string and NOT_A_CODE as the scenario requires."}, {"ref": "spec:design.md", "quote": "Task 5.1 names it, so its red moves `EXPECTED_CODES` to 22 entries under the same title.", "claim": "The design records that the frozen test was changed in place with its old title, explaining the missing red record and the stale title."}]}
